<title>USA: Laurens-Marathon CSD, Iowa, won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Laurens-Marathon CSD, Iowa, won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $1.700 million of Laurens-Marathon CSD, Iowa, general obligation school building bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.39 percent.</p>
</text>
